      // leather06 sections). landing = R_out − rw: DERIVED(85.0 − 52.26 =
      // 32.7; 99.8 − 54.8 = 45.0); band = landing + 4 mm (the mirror's
      // clearance margin, unchanged); proud = crest − cap top: DERIVED(56.2
