      // 84.3 / side 0 — read from the model but hung on the KERNEL disc
      // centre; retired by D621-PLAN-1, below.)
      // D621-PLAN-1 (owner rejection of card 19 from the plan view: the
      // corner ring's arms ran 22 mm INTO the cushion). Cause: the ring was
      // hung on the kernel disc centre (cd = 25.1 mm per axis) with MODEL
