      // Height-datum audit (GH-490 PR-2; refreshed 2026-09-08 per
      // NOTE-CN8-DELTA-COMMENT — astra audit row 12, two refuters):
      // bedAboveFloor is the BED datum; floor→rail top = 790 + 42 (the
