// same seeded stream, but the cord BODY draws darker (0.68L vs 0.84L)
// under a narrower bright crest, so the shadowed interior reads as
// crisp lit cord lines over dark (bimodal, like the photos' flash-lit
// mouth) instead of a mid-gray wash that straddles the white cuts.
