  // gradient read as a smooth emissive ramp, not cloth. Deterministic
  // NAP NOISE rides the ramp — multiplicative luminance grain (woven
  // texel field ± ~7% + faint vertical drag streaks, the damped-cloth
  // read of the GCL fall photos). Mean-preserving, so the §4 tone-law
  // anchors (lip ≥ 0.35 × cloth, d26/lip ratio) hold; the cloth-color
  // contract is untouched (the tinted ramp is painted first, the grain
  // multiplies it).
