  // ~0.61 — dark composite with a working margin under the rail's own
  // paleness, and a distinct hex from the rail's 0x1f1f21 so the gate's
  // classifier still tells the two apart.
  // D621-PLAN-3 (review r4 P1): the D621-LOOK-2 casting re-solve (colour
