      // bright-fraction band-limit per bearing band).
      // GH-489 IDENTITY ROUND, second leg (albedo VALUE re-derive on the
      // measured dossier basis): with the polish response localized the
      // remaining fulltable wash was DIFFUSE — the ablation probe
