      // ratios 0.4919/0.4842/0.4853 — duplicated-literal law).
      woodMat.map = makeWoodMap(9001, 92, 52, 58);
      woodMat.color.setHex(0x6f7a72);
      woodMat.specularIntensity = 0.10;
      // (identity round, corner-close ablation: the residual silver
      // PLANE at the 0.55 m grazing bearings was the BASE GGX lobe at
      // F90 — Fresnel's grazing limit is 1.0 regardless of
      // specularIntensity/coat/env knobs (rects-off 0.675 -> 0.000;
      // coat/spec/env ablations no-ops), so ROUGHNESS is the only
      // physical lever. The wood UNDER a French polish is matte — the
      // gloss belongs to the coat alone. Probe-solved 0.55/0.70/0.80/
