      // into the dark-wood-with-moving-band read.)
      // 489 BLOCKER-CURE (rail-top "wet-chrome zebra" residual, the
      // disclosure-or-cure item): the 0.09 tight coat over the streaked
      // clearcoat normal mirrored the strip as white WAVY SMEARS across
      // the whole rail top at the close bearings (reads wet chrome).
      // Coat roughness 0.09 -> 0.14 + ccNormalScale 0.04 -> 0.025: the
