          // 0.875 R_FALL, κ ≈ 1) is DISCLOSED, not reproduced: it moves
          // the bar past 0.90 (SPIKE-REPORT-CRAFT.md §R1-FIX4).
          // What R1-FIX4 adds to that law is the photograph's floor and
          // its void edge (the two anchors above): T = max(φ_cyl⁹, floor)
          // above the void edge, floor at and inside it.
          // TRAP_FLOOR: secant through the render's own census
          // (d 8.8–14.8 mm band, median V / bed V 111): 0.0613 → 0.126,
