              // stayed byte-identical (the enc_pocketing_progress RED).
              // Re-express the SAME mode as the sock's pendulum WAG about
              // its row-0 lacing station (−0.0125, the corner profile's
              // mouth-rim row): every station below swings along the
              // mouth centreline (the arrival-momentum plane),
              // smoothstep-ramped from the lacing anchor to the full
              // authored amplitude at the ring lace (RING_Y0), the gold
              // ring + studs riding. Amplitude/decay/frequency are the
              // authored triple — zero new motion constants; the dossier
              // (18 stills; INDEX records no video frames) fixes the
              // anatomy (a free-hanging gathered sock — physics says it
              // swings after a catch, the owner story's 回摆衰减 clause)
              // and this cure only moves WHERE the mode expresses, never
              // its magnitude. Runs BEFORE the per-ball wrap pass, so the
              // resting ball stays the anchor: wagged vertices that would
              // enter the ball re-project onto its shell (the sock rolls
              // on the ball, never through it); the liner/shade layers
              // ride the identical field below, keeping every sewn-in
              // clearance law intact.
              // b.sw (review sway-cure r1 P2, feature-detected): the
