        // ladders and the deck umbra/penumbra ladder (authored photo
        // reads: umbra HOLD 0.245, 11 mm trough, 17 mm ramp) are
        // DELETED — one lit family, per-vertex derived transport (the
        // helper above).  The photo-shaped trough now EMERGES from the
        // boot-arch visibility term instead of being stored: the arch
        // stands 13-15 mm over the deck, so deck points near the mouth
