      // pair that actually sets the -2.000 mm midext-protrude reading. It is
      // not a bay-window subject at all (that census counts 27 meshes with
      // and without this row). So it is admitted and reads clean, with
      // 31.36 mm of travel before it could even reach the limit. If it ever
      // did become the outboard extreme at a middle, the fix is to re-seat
